  create_widget:
    kind: mutate
    repeatability: skip-if-recorded
    deadline: 30s
    http: {method: POST, host: "{from-target}", path: /widgets}
    record:
      identity: "{name}"
      fields: {id: $.body.id}

CAPABILITIES        http
BOUND               none
RECORD CARDINALITY  one
RECORD IDENTITY     {name}
REPEATABILITY       skip-if-recorded
DEADLINE            30s
CONCURRENCY LIMIT   1
